    "story": {
      "type": "mp-lp-story",
      "blocks": {
        "paragraph-1": {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>It does not. Longevity comes from the concentration of perfume oil.<br>But more is not automatically better.</p>"
          }
        },
        "paragraph-2": {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>What designer brands and other fragrance dupe brands sell is usually Eau de Toilette.</strong> That means 5 to 15% perfume oil and lots of alcohol. It smells great for an hour, then quietly fades away.</p>"
          }
        },
        "paragraph-3": {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Every bottle of Magic Perfume is an Eau de Parfum with 21% perfume oil.</strong> At this level, the scent settles on your skin instead of evaporating from it.</p>"
          }
        },
        "paragraph-4": {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Between 21 and 30% is the sweet spot: enough to last all day, but not so much that it feels heavy or oily.</strong></p>"
          }
        },
        "paragraph-5": {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>That is where the 8 to 12 hours come from, and it lasts even longer on your shirt.</p>"
          }
        },
        "paragraph-6": {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Spray it in the morning and people can still smell it in the evening.</p>"
          }
        },
        "pillar-7": {
          "type": "pillar",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "drop",
            "title": "21% perfume oil",
            "text": "Eau de Parfum strength and up to 12 hours of wear in every single bottle."
          }
        },
        "pillar-8": {
          "type": "pillar",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "globe",
            "title": "Made in an EU fragrance house",
            "text": "For unmatched similarity. Do not believe it? That is what our 60-day money-back guarantee is for."
          }
        },
        "pillar-9": {
          "type": "pillar",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "leaf",
            "title": "Clean Label",
            "text": "Produced to EU standards. Vegan and cruelty-free. Free from phthalates and parabens."
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "paragraph-1",
        "paragraph-2",
        "paragraph-3",
