    "reviews": {
      "type": "mp-lp-reviews",
      "blocks": {
        "review-1": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "date": "18.08.2026",
            "title": "Comparison: 287M Tom Ford Oud Wood dupe vs. original",
            "text": "I was lucky enough to get a 30ml bottle of the original for my birthday (€120 LOL) and thought, okay, let me try the dupe. Sure, the original is absolutely premium, BUT (!) what they have created here is incredibly close to it. 2–3 sprays and the whole room smells of it, easily for 8–10 hours, too. That is no exaggeration. The original opens up faster, while the dupe takes a few minutes to develop. But if you can try them side by side, an untrained nose will barely notice any difference after a few minutes. […]",
            "name": "Customer",
            "url": "https://www.trustpilot.com/reviews/6a84aa9cea1a4f01ae1dc964"
          }
        },
        "review-2": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "date": "20.08.2026",
            "title": "",
            "text": "My friend that has been using one of the Lancôme perfumes for years, couldn’t tell the difference of my dupe and her own expensive bottle!😂 she thought I also paid over 100 euros. The delivery was fast and I’m very satisfied with the scent and its durability. It stays on for over 12 hours! Will buy again",
            "name": "Rozhin",
            "url": "https://www.trustpilot.com/reviews/6a86d6a0b3aa4a7a1ba16900"
          }
        },
        "review-3": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "date": "16.07.2026",
            "title": "",
            "text": "I am absolutely delighted 🥰 My Gucci Rush 2 fragrance dupe arrived today after 4 working days and it smells 100% like the original. Shipping with GLS was on time and smooth, too.",
            "name": "Stephanie Lippolt",
            "url": "https://www.trustpilot.com/reviews/6a58d0708aa178f2cadd9d71"
          }
        },
        "review-4": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "date": "11.08.2026",
            "title": "High-quality fragrances at fair prices",
            "text": "I ordered fragrance No. 145, inspired by Dior Hypnotic Poison, in the 30ml version. Abi advised me beforehand and gave me all the fragrance information directly – thorough advice, which I really appreciated. Shipping was really quick even though the fragrance came from abroad. It took about 5 working days, which I think is perfectly reasonable. […]",
            "name": "Silvana",
            "url": "https://www.trustpilot.com/reviews/6a7b664ae02952425059159c"
          }
        },
        "review-5": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "date": "21.08.2026",
            "title": "",
            "text": "Magicperfume honestly surprised me 👀✨ It smells like a luxury perfume, lasts really well and, above all, is super affordable. Perfect if you like having several fragrances and wearing a different one for each occasion without spending a fortune. 💕✨",
            "name": "Taniusha Niculita",
            "url": "https://www.trustpilot.com/reviews/6a87e0090d3a665294348bb2"
          }
        },
        "review-6": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "date": "30.05.2026",
            "title": "",
            "text": "Ordered again! The fragrances smell like the original. And they last a very long time! Great.",
            "name": "Karl-Heinz Schulz",
            "url": "https://www.trustpilot.com/reviews/6a1acf7c216e8171ed92b964"
          }
        },
        "review-7": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "date": "14.08.2026",
            "title": "Top quality at great prices!",
            "text": "I was skeptical at first until my mum gave me my first perfume as a gift. The scent lasts unbelievably long – I did not expect that. It does not need an expensive bottle or packaging as long as the fragrance does what it should. That is absolutely the case here! Highly recommended! […]",
            "name": "Chrissy",
            "url": "https://www.trustpilot.com/reviews/6a7f53a13d8226c10527102e"
          }
        },
        "review-8": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "date": "17.06.2026",
            "title": "TOP products",
            "text": "I must admit I am always a little skeptical, but in this case I was pleasantly surprised. After thinking about it for a long time, I bought a perfume that was supposed to smell like Fahrenheit, and what can I say – it really does. I sprayed it on and a stranger actually noticed the scent and asked where I had bought it. Of course I recommended this shop. I can say I am very satisfied and now only buy here.",
            "name": "Charly Meyer",
            "url": "https://www.trustpilot.com/reviews/6a324d021bd2c38b4dcede46"
          }
        },
        "review-9": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
